{"5071040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hammer Bomb", "steam_appid": 5071040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to enter dark mazes and dungeons - full of monster hordes and traps?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then brave the dungeon, Sir Hammer Bomb. Rescue your soldiers and find the treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer Bomb is a new twist on dungeon style arcade games.<br>Easy controls for anyone to play, but only a few will master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop bombs to open secret areas to find the best treasures!<br>Go on quests looking for various types of treats. Cake, Pizza, Hot Dogs,<br>Soda, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and collect all 50 perks to enhance your gameplaying abilities.<br>Use various weapons, bows, swords, magic, and the almighty hammer!<br>Battle Ginormous bosses in each of the biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-An endless amount of mind bending mazes to escape<br>-Great voxel style graphics<br>-Easy to play, simple controls for anyone to play.<br>-Various weapons to use and master<br>-50 perks to upgrade your playing skills<br>-Quests to find in each maze - yummy treats!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to enter dark mazes and dungeons - full of monster hordes and traps?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then brave the dungeon, Sir Hammer Bomb. Rescue your soldiers and find the treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer Bomb is a new twist on dungeon style arcade games.<br>Easy controls for anyone to play, but only a few will master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop bombs to open secret areas to find the best treasures!<br>Go on quests looking for various types of treats. Cake, Pizza, Hot Dogs,<br>Soda, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and collect all 50 perks to enhance your gameplaying abilities.<br>Use various weapons, bows, swords, magic, and the almighty hammer!<br>Battle Ginormous bosses in each of the biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-An endless amount of mind bending mazes to escape<br>-Great voxel style graphics<br>-Easy to play, simple controls for anyone to play.<br>-Various weapons to use and master<br>-50 perks to upgrade your playing skills<br>-Quests to find in each maze - yummy treats!</p>", "short_description": "Hammer Bomb is a totally chill dungeon crawler, super easy to play, amazing music, and lots of perks and upgrades!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071040/0cbef8a184a6e1e2b34164c6d3be69c1f14d34fd/header.jpg?t=1787150149", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071040/a285b390c1f1220085d4498a471d2e2a712a5e19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787150149", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071040/a285b390c1f1220085d4498a471d2e2a712a5e19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787150149", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista SP2, Windows 7 SP1, Windows 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2GHz CPU Intel or AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 400 Series or Radeon 6000 Series, 512MB graphics memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Copyright 2026 Crescent Moon Games", "developers": ["Crescent Moon Games"], "publishers": ["Crescent Moon Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": fal